@hannahgordon60 begin creating hexagonal artwork to have stenciled and put on the bus. I think anything in size from 6inches to 36inches. Color-wise, our #CE2028 red, a light gray, a dark gray, and a black.

Create filled hexagons, outlines that are at least 1inch thick, etc. Title them what they are (e.g. hexagon-24inch-outline-red-4copies). The number of copies is to help us ensure we have enough printed to cover the bus and also have backups if we jack up a sticker or change our minds and want another option. minimum of 4 of each… maximum of 10.

Remember, we have two sides and a back of this bus, so multiples of 2 or 3.
